"type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/5","rules":"Before attacking, you may reduce Hollow Grazer's maximum and current HP by 2 permanently, minimum 1. If you do, it gains +3 STR this round.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-004","name":"Graftkeeper","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/5","rules":"On play, move up to 2 permanent STR or maximum-HP bonus points from your other friendly creatures onto Graftkeeper in any combination.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":2,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-005","name":"Blightmouth","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/4","rules":"The first time each round Blightmouth gains STR or maximum HP, its next damage dealt this round is increased by 2.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-006","name":"The Walking Orchard","type":"Creature","cost":7,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/8","rules":"At the start of your round, choose up to two other friendly Harvest creatures. Each gains +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":8,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-007","name":"Prune the Weak","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Destroy a friendly creature. Another friendly creature gains STR equal to the destroyed creature's current STR, maximum +3 STR, permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-008","name":"Forced Bloom","type":"Spell","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"A friendly creature gains +3 STR this round. After it takes a combat action this round, deal 1 damage to it.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-009","name":"Overgrowth","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"A friendly creature gains +4 maximum and current HP permanently. It cannot take a combat action this round.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-010","name":"Thorn Tithe","type":"Trap","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"After a friendly Harvest creature survives combat damage, it gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-011","name":"Rootbound Tender","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":1,"statsText":"1/3","rules":"Once per round, when another friendly Harvest creature would take Wither damage, it gains +1 maximum and current HP permanently instead.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":1,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-012","name":"Splitbark","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/4","rules":"The first time each round Splitbark gains permanent STR or maximum HP, another friendly creature gains +1 of the same stat permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":2,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-013","name":"Cropjaw","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/4","rules":"While Cropjaw is Nourished this round, it has +2 STR.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-014","name":"Suturevine","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"2/6","rules":"Once per round, move up to 2 damage from another friendly creature onto Suturevine. If any damage is moved, Suturevine gains +1 maximum HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":2,"hp":6,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-015","name":"Heavy Yield","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"3/7","rules":"At the start of your round, you may reduce Heavy Yield's maximum and current HP by 1 permanently, minimum 1. If you do, another friendly creature gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":7,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-016","name":"Orchard Behemoth","type":"Creature","cost":8,"resource":1,"statsText":"5/10","rules":"The first time each round Orchard Behemoth gains permanent maximum HP, it also gains +1 STR permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":5,"hp":10,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-017","name":"Transplant","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Move up to 2 permanent STR or maximum-HP bonus points from one friendly creature to another, preserving the stat type.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-018","name":"Bitter Harvest","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Deal 2 damage to a friendly creature, but not below 1 HP. It gains +2 STR permanently. Draw 1 card.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-019","name":"Cultivate","type":"Spell","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Choose two different friendly creatures. Each gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-020","name":"Ripen Under Pressure","type":"Trap","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"After a friendly creature survives enemy creature damage, it gains +2 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR"},{"id":"HAR-021","name":"Sapkeeper","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"1/3","rules":"The first time each round another friendly creature gains maximum HP, restore 1 HP to it and Sapkeeper gains +1 STR this round.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":1,"hp":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-022","name":"Graft Ox","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"3/5","rules":"The first time each round permanent STR or maximum-HP bonuses are moved onto Graft Ox, it gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":3,"hp":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-023","name":"Thornfed Stag","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"4/4","rules":"The first time each round Thornfed Stag takes damage from one of your own cards or abilities, it gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Harvest","code":"HAR","str":4,"hp":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"HAR-024","name":"Orchard Midwife","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"sta